        <mxCell id="notes" value="Logical OO design: each class combines schema attributes and operations allocated by responsibility from existing module behavior.&#10;Operations are design mappings, not literal Prisma instance methods; signatures are condensed. Page 04 preserves selected actual module functions.&#10;Multiplicity follows the current schema. Checkout creation requires 1–20 orders. External user/product/address IDs are scalar references.&#10;Source: backend/services/order-service/prisma/schema.prisma + src/. Operation mapping: operations.json. Notation: OMG UML 2.5.1." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;fontColor=#000000;fontStyle=0;">
